# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# This one line is the entire point of moving off GitHub Pages. Pages has no
# rewrite rule, so /shift/<id> hit its 404 handler and was answered with the
# app HTML under an HTTP 404 status. Browsers did not care; Googlebot did, and
# will not index a 404 no matter what the body contains.
#
# Here every unmatched path serves index.html with a real 200, so a shift URL
# is a genuine page. Static assets are matched before this rule, so it does not
# shadow /assets/*, the manifest, or the service worker.
/*    /index.html   200
